.policy "ruff-fix003-line-contains-xxx" revision 2
.description "Resolve the issue an XXX comment marks before shipping, or at least replace it with a more descriptive tag such as TODO."
.language python
.mode steer
.scope include "**/*"

// Ruff FIX003 (flake8-fixme): a comment holding the task tag `XXX`, in any case, as the first word after a `#`
// (python/misc-comments). Reported at the comment; Ruff reports at the tag, on the same line.
//   # XXX: something           ← FIX003
//   # a # xxx                  ← FIX003: after another `#`
//   # XXXS                     not reported: not the whole word
#include "python/misc-comments.rr"

.violation FIX003(at: node, d: symbol) code "FIX003"
    "Fix the issue this `{d}` comment flags, then remove the `{d}` note; if the fix belongs in a separate change, replace `{d}` with a more descriptive tag such as `TODO`."
    suppress ruff "FIX003"
FIX003(c, d) :- fixme_tag(c, "xxx", d).
